# Testing & Debugging

## Testing Strategy
- Use pytest for backend testing, React Testing Library for frontend
- Test both success and error paths for all APIs
- Mock external services (OpenAI, Tana API, vector databases)
- Follow existing test patterns in `/tests/` directory

## Debugging Practices
- Use Rich logging with structured output and request ID tracking
- Follow snowflake IDs through request lifecycle for debugging
- Use FastAPI's `/docs` for API testing and exploration
- Monitor vector database memory consumption and performance
